      "updated": 1746597000814,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. CoupanType ( 1: m ) coupan\n  - id.  // restaurent, paymentId, <uuid>\n  - type // restaurnet, paymentment, generic.\n  - coupanId ",
