      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Concurrent: \n\n1. user click on button twice -> sessionId -> already done faile\n2. two user trying to booking seat -> using serialisation/locking with for update -> tell customer\n    aleady booked seat. \n3. general check the redis if no available -> booked etc. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Concurrent: \n\n1. user click on button twice -> sessionId -> already done faile\n2. two user trying to booking seat -> using serialisation/locking with for update -> tell customer\n    aleady booked seat. \n3. general check the redis if no available -> booked etc. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
