    },
    {
      "id": "Iuk7fegWw-ZZNNhiVdQdp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5155.767138559487,
      "y": -547.7987274648808,
      "width": 578.1434326171875,
      "height": 1020,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b58",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 875001770,
      "version": 1487,
      "versionNonce": 322584502,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1746596986774,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "circuit breakder lld\n\n- s1 -> s2 -> s3\n- s3 fail cacaded error\n- circuit breaker to maintain that\n- OPEN, PARTIAL-OPEN, CLOSED\n\n- if open -> it will hit the service. \n- if close -> it will not hit the service.\n- if partial -> it will hit once if receive\nerror -> close else -> open. \n- open -> close (3 retry) -> partial (timeout) -> open\nor close. \n\n\nEntity: CircuitBreakerConfig.\n\n\nCircuitBreakerConfig\n- id \n- failurethreshold\n- successthreshold\n- state // CLOSE, PARTIAL,.OPEN\n- timeout \n- openedAt\n- serviceId\n- Totalfailure\n- total success\n\n\n\nAlgo: \n\n- if we are calling serviceId \n- check circuit breaker config\n- exist\n    - if state close -> hit the url \n        - success good\n        - fail -> retry as per retryCount\n            - success -> its fine\n            - failed -> update status to open, at openedAt time to current.\n    - if state open \n        - if current time - openAt >= timeout.\n            - yes \n                - hit the url once\n                - success -> updated to state PARTIAL.\n                - fail -> update state to OPEN and openAt\n    - if state partial\n        - hit the url once\n            - success -> updated to state close.\n            - fail -> update state to open and update openAt time",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "circuit breakder lld\n\n- s1 -> s2 -> s3\n- s3 fail cacaded error\n- circuit breaker to maintain that\n- OPEN, PARTIAL-OPEN, CLOSED\n\n- if open -> it will hit the service. \n- if close -> it will not hit the service.\n- if partial -> it will hit once if receive\nerror -> close else -> open. \n- open -> close (3 retry) -> partial (timeout) -> open\nor close. \n\n\nEntity: CircuitBreakerConfig.\n\n\nCircuitBreakerConfig\n- id \n- failurethreshold\n- successthreshold\n- state // CLOSE, PARTIAL,.OPEN\n- timeout \n- openedAt\n- serviceId\n- Totalfailure\n- total success\n\n\n\nAlgo: \n\n- if we are calling serviceId \n- check circuit breaker config\n- exist\n    - if state close -> hit the url \n        - success good\n        - fail -> retry as per retryCount\n            - success -> its fine\n            - failed -> update status to open, at openedAt time to current.\n    - if state open \n        - if current time - openAt >= timeout.\n            - yes \n                - hit the url once\n                - success -> updated to state PARTIAL.\n                - fail -> update state to OPEN and openAt\n    - if state partial\n        - hit the url once\n            - success -> updated to state close.\n            - fail -> update state to open and update openAt time",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CAp9acFrJbEhhgzweUtuY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6389.158234778197,
      "y": -502.99184267404235,
      "width": 620.5274047851562,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b59",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 547892778,
      "version": 571,
      "versionNonce": 557416886,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1746596994962,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LUDO game HLD and LLD\n- 4 people palceholder\n- static graph. -> with end node , some special node\n- there are 4 pieces for single player\n- one dice \n- turn by turn\n\n\nflow -> create game -> assign player -> start -> roll dice -> move -> next player\n- if all piece of player wend to end node wins\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LUDO game HLD and LLD\n- 4 people palceholder\n- static graph. -> with end node , some special node\n- there are 4 pieces for single player\n- one dice \n- turn by turn\n\n\nflow -> create game -> assign player -> start -> roll dice -> move -> next player\n- if all piece of player wend to end node wins\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
