      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "how much data we want to show. \n\n\nmatch -> team a score/wicket    -> get data from matchteam\n            team b score/wicket/over\n\nScorecard     -> get data from match player for particular match and team\nteama\n- players batting teama\n- players bolling teamb\n\n\n\nevent -> update matchteam , matchplayer\n\nupdate score,wicket,over\nupdate batting score of player.\nupdate bowling score of player.",
